  "historical_evidence_note": "The prior preparation checkpoint qualified683 fresh tests at its recorded source. Its full Store executable is archived. This checkpoint runs the relevant28 Store cases,2 actual native tests and5 public boundaries; it does not claim to rerun that full earlier suite.",
  "implemented": [
    "An independently current signed target Device/key/connection.offer command must match the original operation, reserved candidate and provisioned Endpoint/Device; original source/retained/operator checks remain separate.",
    "Metadata-only allocation planning retries transient contention without effects. A separate durable begin atomically freezes one possible allocation; neither begin nor Core allocation is retried.",
    "Core prepare_peer_native_device_replacement consumes the actual owned reservation and retains its exact binding/generation on the authenticated physical target. Captured writes reuse an existing target fence and retry only metadata.",
    "The public CanonicalClient.allocate_native_replacement_target method preserves the original root and stable candidate ID. Same-physical identical replay returns progress; changed content or another physical peer cannot duplicate/adopt allocation.",
    "Native target media remains closed and the original source audio/observer role continues. Actual cancellation/controller revocation/endpoint revocation/target credential revocation retire only the candidate and release preparation capacity.",
    "Protected allocation cleanup requires actual absence of the exact native candidate and refuses after start/commit. Historical capture survives revoked target/cancel without granting new IO; unknown work cannot reexecute."
  ],
  "resolved_during_verification": [
    "Contention in a planning read initially caused a transient public failure; retryable read was separated from once-only durable begin. Dedicated SQL contention test proves planning failures add no effect.",
    "Captured writes now reuse an already held target interval instead of acquiring another reader behind a queued writer.",
    "A test fixture initially checked a raw transport batch instead of its correlated application error; assertions now check the batch ACK.",
    "A linker ran out of disk space. Obsolete task-owned compiler object variants were removed with no sources, archives or verification executables deleted; the resumed current build/test completed."
  ],
  "unqualified": [
    "Start/attach/activation/commit custody and actual negotiated isolated target input/output",
    "Durable candidate Connection projection and exact generation2+ replacement lineage adoption in native media/resource policy",
    "Configured telephone callback, trusted answer/DTMF and full no-answer/voicemail/rejection/timeout/late-event/unknown/restart matrix without redial",
    "One actual movement commit/native confirmation, role-preserving projection and intended old-source retirement",
    "Gate6 acceptance, Linux/remote/provider/performance profiles and publication"
  ],
